Write a function `camel_to_snake/1` that takes a string in camelCase format and returns the corresponding snake_case string. For every uppercase letter in the input string, insert an underscore before it and convert the letter to lowercase, except that if the input string starts with an uppercase letter, the resulting leading underscore must be removed. The function should handle empty strings by returning an empty string. The conversion should be applied to all characters in the string.

Complexity: The function should run in O(n) time where n is the length of the string.
---TEST---
defmodule SolutionTest do
